   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "key",
     "style": "definition",
     "title": "Past simple",
     "md": "Action **terminée** à un moment du passé. Forme : verbe + -ed (verbes réguliers) ou forme irrégulière.\n- I **played** football yesterday.\n- She **went** to Yaoundé last week.\n- Négation et question : **did** + verbe de base : I **didn't go**. **Did** you **go** ?"
    },
    {
     "type": "key",
     "style": "definition",
     "title": "Past continuous",
     "md": "Action **en cours** à un moment du passé. Forme : **was / were + verbe en -ing**.\n- At 8 o'clock, I **was studying**.\n- They **were playing** when it started to rain."
    },
